MANGING AUTOMATION OF USER CREATION - WITHOUT ANSIBLE
If you don't want to use Ansible, I would actually recommend a Python-based onboarding tool. Since all three systems (cPanel, Active Directory, and Zoom) expose APIs or automation interfaces, Python is a good fit.
Recommended Directory Structure
user_onboarding/
│
├── users.csv
│
├── config/
│   ├── cpanel.conf
│   ├── zoom.conf
│   └── smtp.conf
│
├── scripts/
│   ├── generate_users.py
│   ├── create_cpanel.py
│   ├── create_zoom.py
│   ├── create_ad.ps1
│   ├── send_email.py
│   └── onboard.py
│
├── reports/
│   └── created_users.csv
│
└── logs/
    └── onboarding.log
