What I Would Do in Your Environment
Since you have:
•	cPanel server (100.125.194.89) 
•	Active Directory 
•	Zoom 
•	Around 17 users now, potentially 150+ later 
I'd build:
1.	One master CSV. 
2.	One Python onboarding script. 
3.	One PowerShell AD script (or Python using LDAP if preferred). 
4.	Success/failure reports. 
5.	Email notifications. 
That solution can comfortably handle 150, 500, or even several thousand users with only minor changes, provided the target systems (AD, cPanel, Zoom) can accept the provisioning rate.


